SUMMARY:All Things Open 2026
DESCRIPTION:All Things Open RTP Meetup\nYear 14 of the [All Things Open co
 nference](https://2026.allthingsopen.org/) will take place Monday\, Octobe
 r 19 and Tuesday\, October 20 in downtown Raleigh\, NC at the Raleigh Conv
 ention Center!\n\nJoin us along with 4\,000+ technologists and nearly ever
 y major technology company and organization in the world. More than 150 se
 ssions and speakers will be featured this year\, which means **the educati
 onal and networking value will be tremendous**.\n\n**Day 1 / Monday\, Oct 
 19:**\n\n* [Extended All-Day AI workshops](https://2026.allthingsopen.org/
 extended-workshop-overview)\n* [15+ 2-hour Deep Dive sessions](https://202
 6.allthingsopen.org/deep-dive-sessions-overview)\n* [4 co-located events](
 https://2026.allthingsopen.org/monday-co-located-event-overview)\, includi
 ng the Community Leadership Summit\, GitHub's Worldwide Accessibility Summ
 it\, the Inclusion & Diversity event\, and Major League Hacking's Mini-AI 
 Hackathon.\n\n**Tuesday\, October 20:**\n\n* [Traditional conference day](
 https://2026.allthingsopen.org/schedule#day=tuesday) featuring morning and
  end-of-day keynotes\, lunchtime Lightning Talks\, and 30-minute breakout 
 sessions across 18 tracks.\n\n**Exclusive Meetup Discount:**\nMembers of t
 his meetup can get a 25% discount by using the registration link below. No
 te\, the discount is applicable to Monday AI All-Day workshops\, Monday De
 ep Dive sessions\, and Tuesday's traditional conference day. It does NOT a
 pply to Monday's co-located events\, which are just $25 each and include l
 unch.\n\n* [ATO RTP meetup discount registration link ](www.eventbrite.com
 /e/1990317243453/?discount=RTPmeetup25)\n\n**Instructions:**\n1\\. Click r
 eg link\n2\\. Click orange "Get Tickets" button\n3\\. Select ticket option
 \n4\\. Proceed with registration\\\, discount will be applied\n\n**Importa
 nt Links:**\n\n* [Conference website](https://2026.allthingsopen.org/)\n* 
 2[026 format explanation](https://2026.allthingsopen.org/2026-format-overv
 iew-a-new-era)\n* [Scholarships & Discounts](https://2026.allthingsopen.or
 g/scholarships-discounts)\n* [Register Now ](https://2026.allthingsopen.or
 g/register)\n* [2026 t-shirt design ](https://2026.allthingsopen.org/offic
 ial-2026-t-shirt-design)\n* [First 25 speakers ](https://2026.allthingsope
 n.org/first-25-speakers)\n* [All speakers ](https://2026.allthingsopen.org
 /speakers)\n* [Traveling to ATO?](https://2026.allthingsopen.org/traveling
 -to-ato-2026)\n\n**Questions?** Contact us at **info@allthingsopen.org**.\
 n\nWe sincerely hope you can join us in downtown Raleigh October 19 & 20!
